<description>&lt;p&gt;President Noboa has asked the United States for $430.5 billion in security aid and met with Pete Hegseth on anti-narco cooperation, while the United States has paused its military partnership with Ecuador after a raid raised questions about possible custody deaths, a suspension the Ecuadorian government denies. Journalist Omar Toledo was shot by motorcycle gunmen and wounded. Fugitive gang boss William Joffre Alcívar Bautista, alias Willy, was arrested in Sitges and deported from Spain. The UCDP recorded 2 battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikwFBVV95cUxQWDVFdFJkdnB5U2UzWE5EczZWZFV0ekE5eHRET2xSRDVTeGJfbWdnUEdCdFVmZEhwajQxd1lNN2NOQno1bWpLNzdyNkNkdWdLSUdDYk00cE5WUDFKUVpRdHUyZklBUkNQNUVWYVZwckZHYVdVbmlJNUJoN1pGeFhfYnVEVVJmWTJObFVnak5BWXN0OFE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Latin Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilAFBVV95cUxPaHF1QmlkZmp4LWFVNmxwMG8wTF90eVBaYmxUQWNYRzhtX2tIR21yTDhNYzBiX3VyckNjVTY5a2o0aTkzOVprb2tSc3owWWNSYlFpSEV1amFJeGo2aFk5R2ZweVlXbzZoWDVqZjM1anNBMFlaclYwUExaY3lCYzlfbEticGp3Mlh5bXZvM1hkQ1NFX3JD?oc=5&quot;&gt;Washington Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxQd0JHSU9NT09WMUljWTdTVUo0OW1IYjhUX01mcFdkUmZhUklaZkRuRFlTN09PbmFaM3RMMTEyYWlIRFN3WlRxQzVfYUZKRVlDZFJsRTVibUY0M2QyRDAxN21qbkZ6MEFMcWNaOGhLYjRSd0lSR3BHVmtTbEdGd19ObFlsWkJxWFhYZTZIQ0tUVlNHTEQySVBSRGNicDZVRkVCN3Y4b3dYN0U?oc=5&quot;&gt;Apa.az&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxPZ1pYTExxNGw1RGRoNUJ0SzNvT0RJZGk4ZTNLZGFMZ3hkY3c2SzBSb0Z6VzRHTE5XNDdoTjlKcjNRR0F1WkNzMVhYUzRIN1ZoZnVEd3dab2NkdTNHd2tmMS1fLU9Uc3pBM1lYTlIyWmEtNy1yQW